(7192141, 1105334, 173844, '<td valign="top">The artwork on the wall has a pleasant, breezy feel against which the plastic utilitarian sign clashes, but in an interesting way that feels like serendipity in light of this challenge.  And there is a connection at work here -- army surplus on the sign, woman in stylish uniform -- that knits together disparate elements.</td>', 'The artwork on the wall has a pleasant, breezy feel against which the plastic utilitarian sign clashes, but in an interesting way that feels like serendipity in light of this challenge.  And there is a connection at work here -- army surplus on the sign, woman in stylish uniform -- that knits together disparate elements.', '2014-03-20 12:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
