(7192195, 1105493, 173844, '<td valign="top">Shiny and bright, assertively playful, this is the poster photo for the challenge.  They could be Tonka Toys.  Comfortably close, overlapping composition.  The lines are clear and bold.</td>', 'Shiny and bright, assertively playful, this is the poster photo for the challenge.  They could be Tonka Toys.  Comfortably close, overlapping composition.  The lines are clear and bold.', '2014-03-20 15:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7192203, 1105883, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely living art.  Well posed, admirably decorated a la Mondrian.  The textures add to the depth of the image.  The lighting is also well done.  I like how the slightly off-center pose and unlevel hands give dynamism to what could have been a static scene.</td>', 'Lovely living art.  Well posed, admirably decorated a la Mondrian.  The textures add to the depth of the image.  The lighting is also well done.  I like how the slightly off-center pose and unlevel hands give dynamism to what could have been a static scene.', '2014-03-20 16:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7192204, 1105776, 173844, '<td valign="top">I really like the brash immediacy of this image, the almost unkempt urgency of the situation.  Whatever has occurred has spilled a sense of chaos into this shot.  Weegee without the bodies.  The primary colors, needless to say (but I''ll say it anyway), jump right out at the viewer.  My personal favorite.  And the stars float just overhead.</td>', 'I really like the brash immediacy of this image, the almost unkempt urgency of the situation.  Whatever has occurred has spilled a sense of chaos into this shot.  Weegee without the bodies.  The primary colors, needless to say (but I''ll say it anyway), jump right out at the viewer.  My personal favorite.  And the stars float just overhead.', '2014-03-20 16:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7192205, 1105883, 159196, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge!</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge!', '2014-03-20 16:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
